{
  "id": "unique-event-021",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "unique-event-021:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": " #21 - digging around the tree\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,506,537]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-021:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "As your shovel breaks through the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,537,571]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-021:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "soft ground, seven moaning,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,571,599]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-021:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "ghostly children emerge from the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,599,632]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-021:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "ground and stare at you with\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,632,661]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-021:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "accusing eyes. Dark blood drips\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,661,693]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-021:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "from their mouths. Their necks\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,693,724]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-021:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have bruises and abrasions,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,724,752]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-021:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "probably the signs of the ropes\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,752,784]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-021:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "with which someone hanged them.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,784,816]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-021:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“Find those who killed us. Bury\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,816,848]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-021:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "them with us. Until you do so, a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,848,881]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-021:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "curse will be on you”.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,881,904]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-021:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You are now cursed by the Seven\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,904,936]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-021:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Sacrifices. Every time you play\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,936,968]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-021:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "through a numbered event, you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,968,998]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-021:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "lose 1 Sanity. The only way to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,998,1029]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-021:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "break the curse is to capture the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1029,1063]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-021:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Rosen family and bring them here\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1063,1096]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-021:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "(to the location where the Rosen\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1096,1129]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-021:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "House is).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1129,1140]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-021:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you didn’t do so already, you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1140,1173]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-021:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "may climb the walnut tree (#19) or\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1173,1208]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-021:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "explore the Rosen mansion (#20).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1208,1241]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-021:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Remember to subtract 1 Sanity per\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1241,1275]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-021:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "every numbered event you visit.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1275,1307]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-021:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Apply the loss at the end of the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1307,1340]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-021:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "event.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[85,1340,1347]]"
    }
  ],
